# Without the set, a closed-set refusal says no and never says what it would have taken.

title: a closed set is checked against and then not handed back
file: internal/ledger/balance.go
run: go test -count=1 -run TestTheKindRefusalOnAListCarriesTheKindAndTheKindsThereAre -v ./internal/ledgerhttp/
--- before
	return &UnknownKindError{Kind: kind, Valid: kinds}
--- after
	return &UnknownKindError{Kind: kind}
